sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Data Science Gateway<br/>(Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HTTPRoute as HTTPRoute<br/>/model-registry/{name}/
    participant Route as Route<br/>{name}-https<br/>TLS reencrypt
    participant Svc as Service ({name})<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>sidecar<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant REST as model-registry<br/>REST container<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>5432/3306 TCP

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 1: Gateway API Mode (RHOAI 3.x)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /model-registry/{name}/api/...<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>Svc: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (serving cert)
    Svc->>KRBP: 8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    KRBP->>KRBP: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(get services in namespace)
    KRBP->>REST: 8080/TCP HTTP<br/>(localhost, no auth)
    REST->>DB: 5432/TCP PostgreSQL<br/>or 3306/TCP MySQL<br/>Configurable SSL, Password auth
    DB-->>REST: Query results
    REST-->>KRBP: JSON response
    KRBP-->>Svc: HTTPS response
    Svc-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS JSON Response

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 2: OpenShift Route Mode
    Client->>Router: GET /v1/model_registry/...<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Router->>Svc: TLS reencrypt via Route<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    Svc->>KRBP: 8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    KRBP->>KRBP: SubjectAccessReview
    KRBP->>REST: 8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    REST->>DB: DB protocol<br/>Configurable SSL
    DB-->>REST: Query results
    REST-->>KRBP: JSON response
    KRBP-->>Router: Response
    Router-->>Client: HTTPS JSON Response

    Note over Client, DB: Flow 3: Model Catalog API Request
    Client->>Gateway: GET /model-catalog/api/...<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>Svc: model-catalog Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    Svc->>KRBP: 8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    KRBP->>KRBP: SubjectAccessReview
    KRBP->>REST: model-catalog REST<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    REST->>DB: model-catalog-postgres<br/>5432/TCP PostgreSQL<br/>Password auth
    DB-->>REST: Catalog data
    REST-->>KRBP: JSON response
    KRBP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS JSON Response
